# Compiler, assembler, linker, and kernel UAPI headers.
# Installed in build toolboxes. Not part of a base system image:
# end-user installs can omit this stage.
# linux-headers are required while compiling (glibc headers include <linux/errno.h>),
# not to run the finished libraries.
# gcc-runtime (libgcc_s, libstdc++), gmp, and mpfr are core-libs: programs
# in the base link them. gcc has its own copies of gmp and mpfr, and mpc,
# built in its tree (BUILD.md "Toolchain").
# A pos build takes linux-headers, binutils and gcc from its reference.
linux-headers
binutils
gcc
# Developer tools and documentation, moved here from the system stage
# (BUILD.md "System stage", OS boundary).
diffutils
patch
